1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,380
Follow a mouthful.

2
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:04,140
Chewed and mixed with saliva in the mouth.

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:08,007
Pushed down the oesophagus by peristalsis.

4
00:00:08,007 --> 00:00:10,559
Churned in the acid stomach into chyme.

5
00:00:10,559 --> 00:00:14,934
Digested and absorbed along six metres of small intestine.

6
00:00:14,934 --> 00:00:19,687
And in the large intestine, water is taken back and faeces are formed.

